                    <td>Small</td>
                    <td>A smaller button. Still meets the WCAG minimum target size.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>1</td>
                    <td>Regular</td>
                    <td>The regular, default button size.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>2</td>
                    <td>Large</td>
                    <td>A larger button, one step above regular.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
